lass="text-blue-300">✓</span>{{ $item }}</li>@endforeach</ul></article><article class="rounded-3xl border border-violet-400/20 bg-violet-400/[.07] p-7"><span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-violet-300">Article-based format</span><h3 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-black">Distinct studies, integrated contribution</h3><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300">Individual manuscripts must still form a doctoral whole. Introductory and concluding synthesis should explain relationships, cumulative contribution, and limits.</p><ul class="mt-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300">@foreach (['Program-approved article requirements','Clear connections among studies','Integrative opening and conclusion'] as $item)<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-violet-300">✓</span>{{ $item }}</li>@endforeach</ul></article></div></div></div></section>

